title: "Riemann Proof Map"
abstract: "An interactive map of the compiled Lean proof of the Riemann Hypothesis and Dirichlet GRH released by Levent Alpöge. Each endpoint has its own immediate-dominator tree and shares a TMAP reference layout, with editable mathematical labels."
